  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Banking &amp; Financial Services -Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The advisors are assisting the Ministry of Finance and Budget (MFB)&apos;s office of the National Coordination of Financial Inclusion (CNFI) with the development of a new National Financial Inclusion Strategy. The advisors are also assisting CNFI with the establishment of appropriate indicators and data management processes to support the measurement and evaluation of Madagascar&apos;s progress toward financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
